Z||000007||Luni420||11-16-2001||07:14 PM||||The red car is my friends, he bought it like that. The guy who owned it before him messed that car up real bad. But anyway the bumper is made by a company called Bomex and it is an MKII MR2 Bodykit bumper. He has the bumper if anyone is willing to pay shipping for it he says. His email addy is triksterut@aol.com let him know if you want him to ship it to you. It probabally cant be used to mount because of the damage unless its fixed but it can be used as an example of where to cut and how to mount it to make it fit. ||||reg||1
