Z||000009||RadRuss||11-16-2001||10:38 PM||||hey try doing it. i have brought that question up here before. i was going to put a veilside on mine though but because of the fact that it might not fit as well as i hoped i went with the eurro fescia from pisa. now that same design came out for the mr2 as an after market bumper for the 2001 line up of products. i just saw it in my new issue of super street. give it a try and talk to triksterut because i did and he had some problems with it. best of luck to u!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature_12.jpg"> ||||reg||14
